# @aeo/llms-txt-generator — environment variables
#
# This app reads NO environment variables. Page titles and descriptions come from
# the crawl, not an LLM, so there are no API keys, OAuth credentials, or paid
# integrations to configure.
#
# Nothing needs to be set here or in the Vercel dashboard to run or deploy the app.
# This file exists only to make that explicit. If a summarizer is added later via
# @aeo/llm, its key must be BYOK / request-scoped (never persisted or logged) —
# document the variable here and in the README at that point.
